23=4.	and since in the Land he neither fashioned the yarn of @wDN{Uttu} @noteref{the goddess of weaving} nor pegged out the loom for @wDN{Uttu} -- with no sheep appearing, 
27=5.	there were no numerous lambs, 
31=6.	and with no goats, 
