{54 = 54-64}
223=54.	They brought wealth to the assembly. They brought sustenance to the Land. 
227=55.	They fulfilled the ordinances of the gods. 
231=56.	They filled the storerooms of the Land with stock. 
235=57.	The barns of the Land were heavy with them. 
239=58.	When they entered the homes of the poor who crouch in the dust they brought wealth. 
